      "updated": 1763993045903,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Connection Handling\n\nJDBC\n\nYou must manually write code:\n\nConnection con = DriverManager.getConnection(url, user, pass);\n\n\nSpring JDBC\n\nUses DataSource (connection factory) + HikariCP pool:\n\n@Autowired\nJdbcTemplate jdbcTemplate;\n\n\nSpring internally gets connection from HikariCP pool, not DriverManager.\n\n✔ Faster\n✔ More scalable",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Connection Handling\n\nJDBC\n\nYou must manually write code:\n\nConnection con = DriverManager.getConnection(url, user, pass);\n\n\nSpring JDBC\n\nUses DataSource (connection factory) + HikariCP pool:\n\n@Autowired\nJdbcTemplate jdbcTemplate;\n\n\nSpring internally gets connection from HikariCP pool, not DriverManager.\n\n✔ Faster\n✔ More scalable",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
