      "updated": 1763993106408,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🟦 3. Connection Pooling\nJDBC\n\n❌ No pooling\nEvery query = new DB connection\nSlow for real applications.\n\nSpring JDBC\n\n✔ Uses HikariCP (default)\n✔ Keeps 10 connections ready\n✔ Very fast and optimized\n✔ You write no pooling code",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🟦 3. Connection Pooling\nJDBC\n\n❌ No pooling\nEvery query = new DB connection\nSlow for real applications.\n\nSpring JDBC\n\n✔ Uses HikariCP (default)\n✔ Keeps 10 connections ready\n✔ Very fast and optimized\n✔ You write no pooling code",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
