      "seed": 1159954772,
      "version": 53,
      "versionNonce": 2030604268,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763993406467,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "6. Resource Closing\nJDBC\n\nYou MUST close everything manually:\n\nrs.close();\nps.close();\ncon.close();\n\n\nIf you forget → memory leak → connection leak.\n\nSpring JDBC\n\nAutomatically closes:\n\nStatement\n\nResultSet\n\nReturns connection to pool\n\nYou cannot leak resources.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "6. Resource Closing\nJDBC\n\nYou MUST close everything manually:\n\nrs.close();\nps.close();\ncon.close();\n\n\nIf you forget → memory leak → connection leak.\n\nSpring JDBC\n\nAutomatically closes:\n\nStatement\n\nResultSet\n\nReturns connection to pool\n\nYou cannot leak resources.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MFsY8UjGDiwsSAV5zuyxo",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 564.6485448570976,
      "y": 5324.190306442754,
      "width": 554.781052564649,
      "height": 255.73768410737466,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
