      "updated": 1763993448149,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "7. Exception Handling\nJDBC\n\nThrows SQLException (checked exception).\nYou MUST use try-catch-finally everywhere.\n\nSpring JDBC\n\nConverts exceptions to Runtime DataAccessException.\n\nNo checked exceptions → cleaner code.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "7. Exception Handling\nJDBC\n\nThrows SQLException (checked exception).\nYou MUST use try-catch-finally everywhere.\n\nSpring JDBC\n\nConverts exceptions to Runtime DataAccessException.\n\nNo checked exceptions → cleaner code.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
