      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763993531220,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "8. Query Mapping (Row Mapping)\nJDBC\n\nYou manually read each column:\n\nstudent.setId(rs.getInt(\"id\"));\n\nSpring JDBC\n\nUse RowMapper:\n\njdbcTemplate.query(\"SELECT * FROM student\", new StudentRowMapper());\n\n\nCleaner & reusable.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "8. Query Mapping (Row Mapping)\nJDBC\n\nYou manually read each column:\n\nstudent.setId(rs.getInt(\"id\"));\n\nSpring JDBC\n\nUse RowMapper:\n\njdbcTemplate.query(\"SELECT * FROM student\", new StudentRowMapper());\n\n\nCleaner & reusable.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
