      "updated": 1763993674360,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "9. Template Pattern\nJDBC\n\nNo template pattern\nYou control every step.\n\nSpring JDBC\n\n-Uses JdbcTemplate which controls:\n\n-Open connection\n\n-Run SQL\n\n-Iterate ResultSet(We dont have to manually iterate jdbc api does for us)\n\n-Close resources\n\n-You only provide logic (RowMapper / SQL).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "9. Template Pattern\nJDBC\n\nNo template pattern\nYou control every step.\n\nSpring JDBC\n\n-Uses JdbcTemplate which controls:\n\n-Open connection\n\n-Run SQL\n\n-Iterate ResultSet(We dont have to manually iterate jdbc api does for us)\n\n-Close resources\n\n-You only provide logic (RowMapper / SQL).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
