      "text": "13. Real-World Use\nJDBC\n\nGood only for:\n\nSmall scripts\n\nHobby projects\n\nSchool assignments\n\nSpring JDBC\n\nUsed for:\n\nEnterprise applications\n\nMicroservices\n\nProduction apps",
