    {
      "id": "rzbH-S6JTewu9vrpTrk-m",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 648.4171262792643,
      "y": 13505.272109740945,
      "width": 462,
      "height": 550,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bGu",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1044938988,
      "version": 36,
      "versionNonce": 561335020,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763994022255,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⭐ Why Spring Boot uses HikariCP?\n\nSpring Boot checks classpath:\n\nIf HikariCP found → use it\nElse Tomcat pool\nElse no pooling\n\n\nHikariCP is preferred because it is:\n\n-Very fast\n\n-Lightweight\n\n-Stable\n\n-Low memory usage\n\n-Production ready\n\nThat's why Spring Boot uses it by default.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⭐ Why Spring Boot uses HikariCP?\n\nSpring Boot checks classpath:\n\nIf HikariCP found → use it\nElse Tomcat pool\nElse no pooling\n\n\nHikariCP is preferred because it is:\n\n-Very fast\n\n-Lightweight\n\n-Stable\n\n-Low memory usage\n\n-Production ready\n\nThat's why Spring Boot uses it by default.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
