      "seed": 1818574572,
      "version": 118,
      "versionNonce": 2022478676,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763994098141,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⭐ How Spring Boot Creates HikariCP Automatically?\n\nYou configure only:\n\napplication.properties\n\nspring.datasource.url=jdbc:postgresql://yourhost/db\nspring.datasource.username=user\nspring.datasource.password=pass\n\n\nSpring Boot internally creates:\n\nHikariDataSource dataSource = new HikariDataSource();\n\n\nAnd sets:\n\n1.URL\n\n2.Username\n\n3.Password\n\n4.Driver\n\n5.Pool size\n\n6.Idle timeout\n\n7.Validation\n\nThen creates:\n\nJdbcTemplate jdbc = new JdbcTemplate(dataSource);\n\n\nSo JdbcTemplate uses HikariCP, not DriverManager.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⭐ How Spring Boot Creates HikariCP Automatically?\n\nYou configure only:\n\napplication.properties\n\nspring.datasource.url=jdbc:postgresql://yourhost/db\nspring.datasource.username=user\nspring.datasource.password=pass\n\n\nSpring Boot internally creates:\n\nHikariDataSource dataSource = new HikariDataSource();\n\n\nAnd sets:\n\n1.URL\n\n2.Username\n\n3.Password\n\n4.Driver\n\n5.Pool size\n\n6.Idle timeout\n\n7.Validation\n\nThen creates:\n\nJdbcTemplate jdbc = new JdbcTemplate(dataSource);\n\n\nSo JdbcTemplate uses HikariCP, not DriverManager.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
