    {
      "id": "qouzdC_TMa6DVJY0cs9X0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 672.6351826305845,
      "y": 17204.368852692012,
      "width": 704,
      "height": 575,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bH6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 695116396,
      "version": 19,
      "versionNonce": 141367380,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763994217809,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "#)HikariCP Flow (Very Simple)\n1. Your code runs JdbcTemplate.query()\n2. JdbcTemplate asks DataSource (HikariCP) for a connection\n3. HikariCP returns an already-open connection\n4. JdbcTemplate runs the SQL\n5. Connection is returned to pool (NOT closed)\n\n⭐ Why HikariCP is Better Than Other Pools?\nFaster\n\nBenchmarks show HikariCP is 2–5x faster than C3P0, BoneCP, DBCP.\n\nLower latency\n\nConnections are handed out faster.\n\nLightweight\n\nOnly essential features → less overhead.\n\nReliable\n\nUsed by Netflix, Spring, Apache, Atlassian.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "#)HikariCP Flow (Very Simple)\n1. Your code runs JdbcTemplate.query()\n2. JdbcTemplate asks DataSource (HikariCP) for a connection\n3. HikariCP returns an already-open connection\n4. JdbcTemplate runs the SQL\n5. Connection is returned to pool (NOT closed)\n\n⭐ Why HikariCP is Better Than Other Pools?\nFaster\n\nBenchmarks show HikariCP is 2–5x faster than C3P0, BoneCP, DBCP.\n\nLower latency\n\nConnections are handed out faster.\n\nLightweight\n\nOnly essential features → less overhead.\n\nReliable\n\nUsed by Netflix, Spring, Apache, Atlassian.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
