    {
      "id": "iEG85fW-9tRgPTSfw72Lm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 687.8165430292727,
      "y": 18609.357927302142,
      "width": 698.4609375,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 321866898,
      "version": 53,
      "versionNonce": 2017669774,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763998030359,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⭐ What is H2 Database?\n\nH2 is a lightweight, fast, in-memory database written in Java.\n\nThink of it as:\n\n✔ A mini temporary database\n✔ Very fast\n✔ Used for testing, learning, and small apps\n✔ Runs inside your Spring Boot application (no external server\nrequired)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⭐ What is H2 Database?\n\nH2 is a lightweight, fast, in-memory database written in Java.\n\nThink of it as:\n\n✔ A mini temporary database\n✔ Very fast\n✔ Used for testing, learning, and small apps\n✔ Runs inside your Spring Boot application (no external server required)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Ny_OXHhPP9VrxrJLfdp1V",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 687.793528000505,
      "y": 18933.33401491283,
      "width": 792.2160588856129,
      "height": 575,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2101467346,
      "version": 85,
      "versionNonce": 358873230,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763998075911,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⭐ Does H2 Come With Spring Boot?\nYES.\n\nSpring Boot automatically supports H2.\n\nWhen you add the dependency:\n\n<dependency>\n    <groupId>com.h2database</groupId>\n    <artifactId>h2</artifactId>\n    <scope>runtime</scope>\n</dependency>\n\n\nSpring Boot automatically:\n\n✔ Adds H2 JDBC driver\n✔ Creates an H2 database in memory\n✔ Creates a JDBC DataSource\n✔ Creates connection pool (HikariCP)\n✔ Shows H2 Console if enabled\n\nSo Spring Boot + H2 = Fully automatic.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⭐ Does H2 Come With Spring Boot?\nYES.\n\nSpring Boot automatically supports H2.\n\nWhen you add the dependency:\n\n<dependency>\n    <groupId>com.h2database</groupId>\n    <artifactId>h2</artifactId>\n    <scope>runtime</scope>\n</dependency>\n\n\nSpring Boot automatically:\n\n✔ Adds H2 JDBC driver\n✔ Creates an H2 database in memory\n✔ Creates a JDBC DataSource\n✔ Creates connection pool (HikariCP)\n✔ Shows H2 Console if enabled\n\nSo Spring Boot + H2 = Fully automatic.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
