      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763998147213,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⭐ Does H2 include both database + driver?\n✔ YES — H2 dependency includes:\n\n1.H2 Database Engine\n\n2.H2 JDBC Driver\n\n3.Server Mode (optional)\n\n4.File Mode (optional)\n\nSo adding H2 dependency is enough to run DB.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⭐ Does H2 include both database + driver?\n✔ YES — H2 dependency includes:\n\n1.H2 Database Engine\n\n2.H2 JDBC Driver\n\n3.Server Mode (optional)\n\n4.File Mode (optional)\n\nSo adding H2 dependency is enough to run DB.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
