      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763998275507,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⭐ Does Spring Boot Automatically Connect to H2?\n\nYES.\n\nIf you include ONLY H2 dependency, Spring Boot automatically\nconfigures:\n\nDataSource → HikariCP → H2 driver → In-memory DB\n\n\nNo need to write username/password unless you want.\n\n⭐ H2 Console\n\nTo view the H2 database in browser:\n\nspring.h2.console.enabled=true\n\n\nThen open:\n\nhttp://localhost:8080/h2-console\n\n\nJDBC URL:\n\njdbc:h2:mem:testdb",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⭐ Does Spring Boot Automatically Connect to H2?\n\nYES.\n\nIf you include ONLY H2 dependency, Spring Boot automatically configures:\n\nDataSource → HikariCP → H2 driver → In-memory DB\n\n\nNo need to write username/password unless you want.\n\n⭐ H2 Console\n\nTo view the H2 database in browser:\n\nspring.h2.console.enabled=true\n\n\nThen open:\n\nhttp://localhost:8080/h2-console\n\n\nJDBC URL:\n\njdbc:h2:mem:testdb",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
