      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1764004583324,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🔍 Why Do We Need RowMapper?\n\nBecause ResultSet contains raw database values (Column-based):\n\nid → 1  \nname → \"John\"  \nage → 22\n\n\nBut your Java program needs:\n\nnew Student(1, \"John\", 22);\n\n\nRowMapper helps you convert SQL → Java, cleanly and efficiently.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🔍 Why Do We Need RowMapper?\n\nBecause ResultSet contains raw database values (Column-based):\n\nid → 1  \nname → \"John\"  \nage → 22\n\n\nBut your Java program needs:\n\nnew Student(1, \"John\", 22);\n\n\nRowMapper helps you convert SQL → Java, cleanly and efficiently.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
