    {
      "id": "TT93yDdnJVO9JsCdVzMph",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 647.5456792300115,
      "y": 35591.42304448715,
      "width": 748,
      "height": 675,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bJ1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 564840306,
      "version": 58,
      "versionNonce": 966665390,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1764004781090,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🔗 How Spring Uses It Internally\n\nWhen you write:\n\njdbcTemplate.query(\"SELECT * FROM student\", new StudentRowMapper());\n\n\nSpring internally does:\n\nwhile (rs.next()) {\n    Student s = rowMapper.mapRow(rs, rowNum);\n    list.add(s);\n    rowNum++;\n}\n\n\nSpring handles:\n\nConnection\n\nPreparedStatement\n\nResultSet loop\n\nClosing resources\n\nYou only write how to map one row.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🔗 How Spring Uses It Internally\n\nWhen you write:\n\njdbcTemplate.query(\"SELECT * FROM student\", new StudentRowMapper());\n\n\nSpring internally does:\n\nwhile (rs.next()) {\n    Student s = rowMapper.mapRow(rs, rowNum);\n    list.add(s);\n    rowNum++;\n}\n\n\nSpring handles:\n\nConnection\n\nPreparedStatement\n\nResultSet loop\n\nClosing resources\n\nYou only write how to map one row.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
