      "text": "🛠️ 3. Example to Understand Clearly\nYour RowMapper:\npublic class StudentRowMapper implements RowMapper<Student> {\n    @Override\n    public Student mapRow(ResultSet rs, int rowNum) throws SQLException\n{\n        Student s = new Student();\n        s.setId(rs.getInt(\"id\"));\n        s.setName(rs.getString(\"name\"));\n        s.setAge(rs.getInt(\"age\"));\n        return s;\n    }\n}\n\n\n\nJdbcTemplate does:\nResultSet rs = statement.executeQuery();\n\nList<Student> list = new ArrayList<>();\nint rowNum = 0;\n\nwhile(rs.next()) {\n    Student s = rowMapper.mapRow(rs, rowNum);\n    list.add(s);\n    rowNum++;\n}\n\n\n✔ Loop\n✔ Not recursion\n✔ RowMapper is called ONCE PER ROW",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🛠️ 3. Example to Understand Clearly\nYour RowMapper:\npublic class StudentRowMapper implements RowMapper<Student> {\n    @Override\n    public Student mapRow(ResultSet rs, int rowNum) throws SQLException {\n        Student s = new Student();\n        s.setId(rs.getInt(\"id\"));\n        s.setName(rs.getString(\"name\"));\n        s.setAge(rs.getInt(\"age\"));\n        return s;\n    }\n}\n\n\n\nJdbcTemplate does:\nResultSet rs = statement.executeQuery();\n\nList<Student> list = new ArrayList<>();\nint rowNum = 0;\n\nwhile(rs.next()) {\n    Student s = rowMapper.mapRow(rs, rowNum);\n    list.add(s);\n    rowNum++;\n}\n\n\n✔ Loop\n✔ Not recursion\n✔ RowMapper is called ONCE PER ROW",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
