      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. What exactly calls mapRow() repeatedly?\n\nThe JdbcTemplate.query() method:\n\npublic <T> List<T> query(String sql, RowMapper<T> rowMapper) {\n    return resultSetExtractor.extractData(resultSet)\n}\n\n\nInternally:\n\nwhile(rs.next()) {\n    list.add(rowMapper.mapRow(rs, rowNumber++));\n}\n\n\nSpring handles the looping.\nYour RowMapper only handles mapping a single row.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. What exactly calls mapRow() repeatedly?\n\nThe JdbcTemplate.query() method:\n\npublic <T> List<T> query(String sql, RowMapper<T> rowMapper) {\n    return resultSetExtractor.extractData(resultSet)\n}\n\n\nInternally:\n\nwhile(rs.next()) {\n    list.add(rowMapper.mapRow(rs, rowNumber++));\n}\n\n\nSpring handles the looping.\nYour RowMapper only handles mapping a single row.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
