      "text": "📌 StudentRequestDTO\n\n(Used when client sends data → Add Student)\n\npublic class StudentRequestDTO {\n    private String name;\n    private int age;\n\n    public String getName() { return name; }\n    public void setName(String name) { this.name = name; }\n\n    public int getAge() { return age; }\n    public void setAge(int age) { this.age = age; }\n}\n\n📌 StudentResponseDTO\n\n(Used when sending response back to client)\n\npublic class StudentResponseDTO {\n    private int id;\n    private String name;\n    private int age;\n\n    public StudentResponseDTO(int id, String name, int age) {\n        this.id = id;\n        this.name = name;\n        this.age = age;\n    }\n\n    // getters\n    public int getId() { return id; }\n    public String getName() { return name; }\n    public int getAge() { return age; }\n}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "📌 StudentRequestDTO\n\n(Used when client sends data → Add Student)\n\npublic class StudentRequestDTO {\n    private String name;\n    private int age;\n\n    public String getName() { return name; }\n    public void setName(String name) { this.name = name; }\n\n    public int getAge() { return age; }\n    public void setAge(int age) { this.age = age; }\n}\n\n📌 StudentResponseDTO\n\n(Used when sending response back to client)\n\npublic class StudentResponseDTO {\n    private int id;\n    private String name;\n    private int age;\n\n    public StudentResponseDTO(int id, String name, int age) {\n        this.id = id;\n        this.name = name;\n        this.age = age;\n    }\n\n    // getters\n    public int getId() { return id; }\n    public String getName() { return name; }\n    public int getAge() { return age; }\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
