      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1764006369462,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "📦 2. DTO Layer\n\n📍 Files:\n\nStudentRequestDTO.java\n\nStudentResponseDTO.java\n\n📍 Job:\n\nCarry data between Controller ↔ Service\n\nValidation (optional)\n\nPrevent exposing Entity directly to client\n\n📍 Example:\n\n{\n  \"name\": \"Shiv\",\n  \"age\": 22\n}\n\n\nDTO ≠ Entity\nDTO is for external communication only.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "📦 2. DTO Layer\n\n📍 Files:\n\nStudentRequestDTO.java\n\nStudentResponseDTO.java\n\n📍 Job:\n\nCarry data between Controller ↔ Service\n\nValidation (optional)\n\nPrevent exposing Entity directly to client\n\n📍 Example:\n\n{\n  \"name\": \"Shiv\",\n  \"age\": 22\n}\n\n\nDTO ≠ Entity\nDTO is for external communication only.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
