      "updated": 1764006650960,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🛢️ 5. Database\n\nTables:\n\nstudent(id, name, age)\n\n\nRepository handles CRUD.\n\n🧭 Flow of a Real API Request\nClient → POST /student/add\n{\n  \"name\": \"Aman\",\n  \"age\": 23\n}\n\nStep-by-step:\n\n1️⃣ Controller receives request → builds StudentRequestDTO\n2️⃣ Controller calls Service.addStudent(dto)\n3️⃣ Service converts dto → Entity\n4️⃣ Service calls Repository.save(entity)\n5️⃣ Repository uses JdbcTemplate to run SQL\n6️⃣ Repository returns DB result → Entity\n7️⃣ Service converts Entity → ResponseDTO\n8️⃣ Controller returns ResponseDTO as JSON",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🛢️ 5. Database\n\nTables:\n\nstudent(id, name, age)\n\n\nRepository handles CRUD.\n\n🧭 Flow of a Real API Request\nClient → POST /student/add\n{\n  \"name\": \"Aman\",\n  \"age\": 23\n}\n\nStep-by-step:\n\n1️⃣ Controller receives request → builds StudentRequestDTO\n2️⃣ Controller calls Service.addStudent(dto)\n3️⃣ Service converts dto → Entity\n4️⃣ Service calls Repository.save(entity)\n5️⃣ Repository uses JdbcTemplate to run SQL\n6️⃣ Repository returns DB result → Entity\n7️⃣ Service converts Entity → ResponseDTO\n8️⃣ Controller returns ResponseDTO as JSON",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
